| description = Just inside the entrance of Neriak's 3rd Gate, surrounded by a nice moat is the Temple dedicated to the [[Prince of Hate]]. Here the Priests of Innoruuk, under the leadership of [[Perrir Zexus]] train clerics of all seasons. 

The priests are loyal to the Dark Elf [[King Naythox Thex]]. Dedicated to Hate, there is no Love lost on the Dark Elven [[Queen Cristanos Thex]] and her allies, [[The Dead]]. The Priests of Innoruk oppose the [[Priests of Marr]] in North Freeport, the [[Clerics of Tunare]] in Felwithe, and the [[Priests of Life]] in Qeynos.

